WEBVTT

00:00:08.915 --> 00:00:10.830
HERMIONE:
How are Fred
and George doing it?

00:00:10.873 --> 00:00:13.093
Half the Alley's closed down.

00:00:13.137 --> 00:00:16.053
RON:
Fred reckons people need
a laugh these days.

00:00:16.096 --> 00:00:18.142
HARRY:
I reckon he's right.

00:00:19.926 --> 00:00:22.102
HERMIONE:
Oh, no.

00:00:22.146 --> 00:00:24.365
Everyone got their wands
from Ollivander's.

00:00:36.769 --> 00:00:38.162
Harry?

00:00:39.946 --> 00:00:42.079
Is it me, or do Draco
and Mummy look like two people

00:00:42.122 --> 00:00:44.385
who don't want to be followed?

00:00:44.429 --> 00:00:46.431
[♪♪♪]

00:01:02.273 --> 00:01:05.450
[SPEAKING INDISTINCTLY]

00:01:07.452 --> 00:01:09.454
[DOG BARKING]

00:01:15.895 --> 00:01:17.897
[BELL RINGING]

00:02:29.229 --> 00:02:30.535
LUNA:
Quibbler.

00:02:32.319 --> 00:02:33.886
Quibbler.

00:02:35.801 --> 00:02:37.281
He's lovely.

00:02:37.324 --> 00:02:40.545
They've been known to sing
on Boxing Day, you know.

00:02:40.588 --> 00:02:42.982
Quibbler?Oh, please.

00:02:44.375 --> 00:02:46.855
What's a Wrackspurt?They're invisible creatures.

00:02:46.899 --> 00:02:50.032
They float in your ears
and make your brain go fuzzy.

00:02:50.598 --> 00:02:52.209
Quibbler.

00:03:02.610 --> 00:03:05.439
RON:
So what was Draco doing
with that weird-looking cabinet?

00:03:05.483 --> 00:03:07.354
And who were all those people?

00:03:07.398 --> 00:03:10.705
Don't you see? It was
a ceremony, an initiation.

00:03:10.749 --> 00:03:12.794
Stop it, Harry.
I know where you're going.

00:03:12.838 --> 00:03:15.449
It's happened.
He's one of them.

00:03:15.493 --> 00:03:17.712
One of what?

00:03:17.756 --> 00:03:19.584
Harry is under
the impression Draco Malfoy

00:03:19.627 --> 00:03:21.325
is now a Death Eater.

00:03:21.368 --> 00:03:23.327
You're barking.

00:03:23.370 --> 00:03:25.720
What would You-Know-Who
want with Malfoy?

00:03:25.764 --> 00:03:27.896
Well, then what's he doing
in Borgin and Burkes?

00:03:27.940 --> 00:03:29.985
Browsing for furniture?

00:03:30.029 --> 00:03:32.031
It's a creepy shop.
He's a creepy bloke.

00:03:32.074 --> 00:03:34.076
Look, his father
is a Death Eater.

00:03:34.120 --> 00:03:35.904
It only makes sense.

00:03:35.948 --> 00:03:37.819
Besides, Hermione saw it
with her own eyes.

00:03:37.863 --> 00:03:41.170
I told you, I don't know
what I saw.

00:03:42.781 --> 00:03:44.435
I need some air.

00:03:53.618 --> 00:03:55.620
[♪♪♪]

00:04:01.147 --> 00:04:04.977
MAN:
Don't worry. When we get
to Hogwarts, we'll sort it out.

00:04:20.775 --> 00:04:24.083
[CHATTERING]

00:04:25.345 --> 00:04:27.173
DRACO:
What was that? Blaise?

00:04:27.216 --> 00:04:29.131
BLAISE:
Don't know.

00:04:29.175 --> 00:04:32.004
PANSY:
Relax, boys. It's probably just
a first-year messing around.

00:04:32.047 --> 00:04:35.442
Come on, Draco. Sit down.
We'll be at Hogwarts soon.

00:04:44.756 --> 00:04:48.934
Hogwarts. What a pathetic
excuse for a school.

00:04:48.977 --> 00:04:51.110
I'd pitch myself off
the Astronomy Tower

00:04:51.153 --> 00:04:53.373
if I had to continue
for another two years.

00:04:53.417 --> 00:04:54.853
What's that supposed to mean?

00:04:56.202 --> 00:04:57.899
Let's just say I don't think
you'll see me

00:04:57.943 --> 00:04:59.684
wasting my time
in Charms class next year.

00:04:59.727 --> 00:05:01.686
[BLAISE LAUGHS]

00:05:01.729 --> 00:05:04.993
Amused, Blaise?

00:05:05.037 --> 00:05:07.474
We'll see just who's laughing
in the end.

00:05:29.235 --> 00:05:33.021
You two go on.
I wanna check something.

00:05:35.546 --> 00:05:37.112
Where's Harry?

00:05:37.156 --> 00:05:39.985
He's probably already
on the platform. Come on.

00:05:55.653 --> 00:05:57.132
DRACO:
Didn't Mummy ever tell you

00:05:57.176 --> 00:05:59.308
it was rude to eavesdrop,
Potter?

00:05:59.352 --> 00:06:00.919
Petrificus Totalus.

00:06:12.104 --> 00:06:13.845
Oh, yeah,

00:06:13.888 --> 00:06:16.413
she was dead before you could
wipe the drool off your chin.

00:06:19.328 --> 00:06:20.591
[GRUNTS]

00:06:22.767 --> 00:06:25.987
That's for my father.
Enjoy your ride back to London.

